    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d435">

                <pb facs="0533" n="523" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg523"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50 Recovery/5–2448: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-05-24T20:00:00-04:00">May 24, 1948—8 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>773. Text draft China Aid Bilateral Agreement being sent following
                        telegram<anchor n="68" xml:id="d435-f1"/> for immediate presentation Chinese
                    Govt to allow time study and translation as suggested by Embassy. Emb requested
                    inform Chinese that present text is draft to which US may wish make <pb
                        facs="0534" n="524" xml:id="pg524"/> subsequent additions or modifications;
                    that agreement has been written substantially in accordance with statutory
                    provisions or legislative history of China Aid Act; that US is treating draft
                    agreement and negotiation thereon as confidential and requests ChiGovt do
                    likewise.</p>
                <p>NAC<anchor n="69" xml:id="d435-f2"/> considering advisability inclusion Article
                    VIII requiring ChiGovt consultation with US Govt regarding exchange rate policy.
                    Similar article requiring consultation International Monetary Fund or US Govt
                    being included European Agreements. Emb should delete Article VIII and
                    parenthetical note in text presented ChiGovt, renumbering subsequent articles
                    accordingly.</p>
                <p>Delete text Article III (Three) in draft given Chinese, but retain numbered
                    heading, adding parenthetical note, as follows: Govt of the US will submit
                    provisions regarding improvement of commercial relations at later stage in the
                    negotiation.</p>
                <p>Substantive comments various points will be telegraphed prior June 1.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
